  "one turn, which is not a repair; and one observation whose parent is not in the set,",
  "which must stay unresolved rather than being counted into a turn to make the sums",
  "come out. Written by hand rather than captured, so every number in test_bench.py is",
  "arithmetic somebody can check against this file."
